/* bias-scalar/1: machine-readable X-macro registry; strings are case sensitive.
 * G(scope,ASDF prefix,FITS group), M(ASDF suffix,FITS suffix),
 * Q(scope,ASDF name,FITS name), C(kind,original text,FITS code).
 * scope 0=product, 1=input. Legacy scalars keep their existing cards. */
